MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The 16TB drive feels like a useful expansion beyond my older 4TB drive, and its recovery service connects with my previous interest in protecting stored data.",
    "The Blink bundle and smart plug give my existing Echo devices useful new jobs: video monitoring alongside my door alarm and voice control for a lamp."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The older Echo Dot and both streaming sticks repeat functions covered by my newer Echo Dot, Echo Show, and Fire TV Stick 4K Max, so their familiarity does not give me a reason to choose them.",
    "Alexa in the car, wireless earbuds, and another entertainment screen do not address a need I have now. The HDMI cable fits my equipment, but I have no current need for that length."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My repeated Echo and Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in more of those devices, even when the suggested versions offer no useful improvement.",
    "My history with electronics seems to have been stretched into interest in unrelated gadgets, without a clear connection to what I would use them for."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent device purchases matter because they already cover needs that older or less capable versions would duplicate.",
    "A useful addition matters more to me than simple resemblance: more backup capacity, video monitoring, or lamp control gives existing equipment a new purpose."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my home technology interests, but match me best when they expand what I can do rather than repeat what I already have."
}
